# OVL-6: each Guide shortcut at its default opens what its label says: Guide + Y the numpad,
# Guide + LB the media controls, Guide + Start Quick Settings, Guide + R3 mouse mode. (Screenshot,
# recording and force quit do real things on the desktop and are left to HW checks.)
press guide
advance 100
tap north 60
release guide
advance 400
expect overlay showing numpad
tap east 700
advance 300
expect overlay showing none
press guide
advance 100
tap lb 60
release guide
advance 400
expect overlay showing media
tap east 700
advance 300
expect overlay showing none
press guide
advance 100
tap start 60
release guide
advance 400
expect overlay showing in-game-menu
tap east 700
advance 300
expect overlay showing none
press guide
advance 100
tap rs 60
release guide
advance 400
---
shifts mode Guide layers -                            @0
overlay none + info 1                                 @100
shifts mode - layers -                                @100
overlay keyboard                                      @100
sound numpad Open pop                                 @100
overlay none                                          @1260
sound numpad Close pop                                @1260
shifts mode Guide layers -                            @1560
overlay none + info 1                                 @1660
shifts mode - layers -                                @1660
overlay media                                         @1660
sound media Open pop                                  @1660
overlay none                                          @2120
sound media Close pop                                 @2120
shifts mode Guide layers -                            @3120
overlay none + info 1                                 @3220
shifts mode - layers -                                @3220
overlay menu "In-game menu" selected "Quick Settings" @3220
sound guide Open rise                                 @3220
overlay none                                          @3680
sound guide Close fall                                @3680
shifts mode Guide layers -                            @4680
overlay none + info 1                                 @4780
shifts mode Mouse mode layers -                       @4840
